ositively identified as the permitted class, FAIL.\",\"expected_outputs\":\"TN verification artifact registered on item 2498 with PASS or FAIL.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"- A TN artifact is registered on item 2498 with a verdict and one status entry per criterion id.\\n- Verdict is PASS only when: all five equivalence criteria pass at TN; both landing criteria transitioned fail-to-pass; the characterisation diff contains zero differences outside the single permitted class; the combination-id set is identical; and all of requirement 6's checks hold.\\n- On FAIL, the report names the exact criterion, the exact combination id (for characterisation diffs), and the exact differing field \\u2014 not a summary.\",\"verification_steps\":\"1. Re-run every check-command and capture untruncated output.\\n2. Produce an explicit side-by-side per-criterion table: criterion id, T0 result, TN result, status.\\n3. For `view-path-characterisation`, produce the literal diff, not a description of it.\\n4. Run requirement 6's five extra checks and record each result.\",\"handoff\":\"PASS unblocks `/dh:complete-implementation` for item #2498. FAIL blocks it and names the specific regression.\",\"analysis_method\":\"none\",\"divergence_notes\":0,\"accuracy_risk\":\"medium\",\"is_bookend\":true,\"bookend_type\":\"tn-verification\"}],\"source_path\":null,\"state\":\"ready\",\"acceptance_criteria_structured\":[{\"criterion_id\":\"import-contract\",\"description\":\"Every symbol consumers import today remains importable from its original path (feature-context outcome #2, risk R1). Covers the operations.py symbols and server.py symbols in scope, plus the dh_core facade.\",\"check_command\":\"uv run python -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,'plugins/development-harness'); from backlog_core.operations import _build_sections_index_from_body,_filter_sections,_build_sections_metadata,_build_sections_compact,_apply_body_section_filter,_resolve_section_indices,_int_field,_compact_entry_count,_buil