ver exists, so the command is valid at both T0 and TN.\",\"check_command\":\"uv run prek run --files plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/*.py\",\"expected_baseline\":\"pass\",\"expected_final\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"mcp-tool-count\",\"description\":\"The backlog MCP server still starts and exposes exactly 46 tools (feature-context outcome #3). Baseline count measured 2026-09-03.\",\"check_command\":\"uv run --script scripts/run_bounded.py --timeout-seconds 180 -- env FASTMCP_SHOW_SERVER_BANNER=false FASTMCP_LOG_ENABLED=false uv run fastmcp list --command \\\"uv run --script $PWD/plugins/development-harness/scripts/run_backlog_server.py\\\" --json | uv run python -c \\\"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); t=d.get('tools',d); n=len(t); print(n); sys.exit(0 if n==46 else 1)\\\"\",\"expected_baseline\":\"pass\",\"expected_final\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"decomposition-happened\",\"description\":\"The three new modules exist and both source modules shrank. Fails at T0 (modules absent) and passes at TN \\u2014 this is the criterion that proves the refactor actually landed rather than merely not regressing.\",\"check_command\":\"uv run python -c \\\"import pathlib,sys; d=pathlib.Path('plugins/development-harness/backlog_core'); new=[d/'section_filter.py',d/'view_assembly.py',d/'view_budget.py']; missing=[str(p) for p in new if not p.exists()]; ops=len((d/'operations.py').read_text().splitlines()); srv=len((d/'server.py').read_text().splitlines()); print({'missing':missing,'operations_lines':ops,'server_lines':srv}); sys.exit(1 if missing or ops>=5407 or srv>=4640 else 0)\\\"\",\"expected_baseline\":\"fail\",\"expected_final\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"adr-recorded\",\"description\":\"The package-vs-launcher decision is recorded in a durable location (feature-context outcome #5) at the plugin's established ADR path.\",\"check_command\":\"test -f plugins/development-harness/docs/adrs/ADR-2498-1-backlog-core-is-a-package.md\",\"expected_baseline\":\